From: Taoufik Mouadab <27153304+TaoufikGFX@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH 0003] Modules: animated GIF playback, silent disc probing, Wayland EGL fixes

- Animated GIFs go to avformat (play and loop); still GIFs stay on the image demuxer
- dvdread no longer shows an error dialog when probing regular files
- EGL/Wayland: work without EGL_KHR_display_reference, swap interval 0,
  opt-in device diagnostics; SHM output respects a provider-owned viewport

Applies on top of VLC upstream commit e77e49b5dff7484dbf70cd1540a6a568e1890280.
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
